## Decision Table

| Task | Model to Use |
|---|---|
| Multi-file backend refactor | `deepseek-v4-pro` |
| Supabase logic, RLS, Edge Functions | `deepseek-v4-pro` |
| Agentic coding pipeline | `deepseek-v4-pro` |
| Large codebase analysis (>50K tokens) | `deepseek-v4-pro` |
| Fast chat, drafting, summarization | `deepseek-v4-flash` |
| High-volume automated pipeline | `deepseek-v4-flash` |
| UI component design and polish | Claude (Cursor native) |
| Bug fix with minimal diff | Claude (Cursor native) |
| Code documentation and comments | Claude (Cursor native) |
| Inline IDE coding (Cursor chat/agent) | Claude (Cursor native) |

---

## Applied to PasteCraft

- **Background service worker logic, sync handlers, storage adapters** → `deepseek-v4-pro`
- **Supabase migrations, RLS policies, Edge Function rewrites** → `deepseek-v4-pro`
- **Popup UI, widget layout, design consistency** → Claude in Cursor
- **High-volume clip processing or batch operations** → `deepseek-v4-flash`
- **Daily Cursor chat and agent tasks** → Claude (default, keep as-is)

---

## Notes

- Never store `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` in the extension bundle. Use Supabase Edge Functions or server-side environments only.
- DeepSeek weights are open-source on HuggingFace — self-hosting is an option for sensitive workloads.
- Benchmark source: DeepSeek V4 tech report, April 24, 2026. Re-evaluate on each major version release.
